      </j:conditional>
      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>This song is performed in honor of the Ḥatan Bereshit – the person who reads the first aliya of the torah, which begins Bereshit Bara. These words – Bereshit Bara – are repeated throughout the poem. The poem is similar in structure and meter to Kelil Yofi, which is performed in honor of the Hatan Torah, the person who reads the last aliya of the Torah, which begins Vaya’al Moshe.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_39011_introduction"/>
